==German==
{{wikipedia|lang=de|Abfahrt}}

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈapfaːɐt]}}

===Etymology===
* Compound of ''[[ab]]'' (‘from’) and ''[[Fahrt]]'' (‘run, drive, ride, journey, trip’), cf. ''[[abfahren]]'' (‘to depart, to leave’).

===Noun===
'''Abfahrt'''

# [[departure]]
#: ''[[fünf|Fünf]] [[Minute]]n [[vor]] '''Abfahrt''' [[des]] [[Zug]]es.''
#:: Five minutes before train departure.
# {{sports|lang=de}} [[downhill]]
# [[slip road]]

====Synonyms====
* {{sense|departure}} [[Abreise]], ([[Abflug]])
* {{sense|slip road}} [[Ausfahrt]]

